<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@/~cl_13> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "13" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@> .
