<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@/~cl_17> <https://schema.org/text> "Subseksyen 147(1) Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “subparagraph (c)(iii),” perkataan “and paragraph (ca)”. Pindaan seksyen 204GA"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@> .
