<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@/~cl_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Perenggan 14(1)(i) Kanun dipinda dengan memasukkan selepas perkataan “officers” perkataan “or any collecting agent as approved by the State Authority.”. Pindaan seksyen 62"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2007/49/msa@> .
